  "solution": {
    "text": "According to the given figure $X$ is at lower potential w.r.t $Y$. Hence, both diodes are in reverse biasing, so, equivalent circuit can be redrawn as follows\r\n<img src=\"assets\\st0007_569b22ca89c1.png\"><br>\r\nEquivalent resistance between $X$ and $Y$\r\n$$\r\nR_{\\text {eq }}=8+2+6=16 \\Omega\r\n$$"
